# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every working tree (2026-11-27): trees are
# byte-identical whoever checks them out, so builds and file hashes agree. Binaries are detected
# and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd and Windows PowerShell 5.1 read these files: keep CRLF (and they stay ASCII)
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# signed release files used as test fixtures (test/fixtures/feeds): their bytes are what the signature covers -
# never converted
test/fixtures/feeds/** -text
